{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimalist Instagram gallery section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the supplied reference screenshot as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: Do not redesign or reinterpret the reference. Maintain the exact layout, image proportions, spacing, typography, colours, alignment, and visual hierarchy.
    
    1. OVERALL SECTION DESIGN
    
    Full-width Shopify section.
    
    Background colour: pure white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop horizontal padding: 55px.
    
    Desktop vertical padding: 65px.
    
    Minimal, clean, premium editorial aesthetic.
    
    Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    
    No gradients, heavy shadows, or decorative backgrounds.
    
    2. HEADER – LEFT ALIGNMENT
    
    Create a header at the top-left.
    
    Eyebrow text:
    
    "— #KISSANDKRY"
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Size: 9px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: muted olive (#777D5D).
    
    Position above the main heading.
    
    Main heading:
    
    "Tiny Moments, Shared."
    
    Font: Montserrat Bold.
    
    Size: 36px desktop.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Line height: 1.2.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    Margin-top: 8px.
    
    3. INSTAGRAM FOLLOW BUTTON
    
    Position the Instagram follow button at the top-right of the section.
    
    Button content:
    Instagram outline icon + "Follow @kissandkry"
    
    Design:
    
    White background.
    
    Thin olive-grey border (#C9CDBD).
    
    Pill-shaped border radius: 30px.
    
    Height: 42px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 20px.
    
    Font: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Text colour: #626B4C.
    
    Instagram icon: small, 13px.
    
    Vertically centred content.
    
    Subtle hover transition.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Make the entire button clickable.
    
    Link to the Instagram profile: https://www.instagram.com/kissandkry/
    
    Open in a new tab.
    
    4. INSTAGRAM IMAGE GALLERY
    
    This is the most important component.
    
    Create a single horizontal row containing EXACTLY SIX equally sized image tiles on desktop.
    
    Layout specifications:
    
    Six columns.
    
    Equal image dimensions.
    
    Image aspect ratio: approximately 1:1.
    
    Desktop image dimensions: approximately 160px × 160px.
    
    Horizontal gap: 10px.
    
    Border radius: 12px.
    
    Object-fit: cover.
    
    Object-position: center.
    
    No borders.
    
    No heavy shadows.
    
    All images must have identical dimensions.
    
    The gallery must span almost the entire available content width., IMAGE 1 – BABY CLOSE-UP
    
    Close-up lifestyle photograph of a smiling baby.
    
    Baby wearing a mustard-yellow bamboo outfit.
    
    Face clearly visible.
    
    Natural warm lighting.
    
    Soft premium photography.
    
    IMAGE 2 – BABY IN WHITE
    
    Baby wearing a white bamboo babywear outfit.
    
    Baby sitting comfortably against a soft knitted cream blanket.
    
    Warm natural lighting.
    
    Premium editorial photography.
    
    IMAGE 3 – INSTAGRAM FEATURE TILE
    
    Create a special Instagram promotional tile instead of a baby photograph.
    
    Background: muted olive green (#626B4C).
    
    Add subtle, low-opacity bamboo leaf illustrations.
    
    Place a white Instagram outline icon in the centre.
    
    Below the icon, display:
    "View on Instagram"
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Text colour: white.
    
    Keep the design minimal and centred.
    
    Make the entire tile clickable and link to the Instagram profile.
    
    IMAGE 4 – BABY IN SOFT WHITE
    
    Lifestyle photograph of a baby wearing a soft white bamboo outfit.
    
    Baby lying comfortably on a cream-coloured blanket.
    
    Natural daylight.
    
    Gentle, premium appearance.
    
    IMAGE 5 – BABY ON TEXTURED BLANKET
    
    Baby wearing a pale yellow bamboo outfit.
    
    Baby lying on a fluffy mustard-yellow / cream textured blanket.
    
    Top-down lifestyle photography.
    
    Warm and soft colour grading.
    
    IMAGE 6 – BABY IN WHITE OUTFIT
    
    Happy baby wearing a white bamboo outfit.
    
    Baby sitting or lying on a soft neutral blanket.
    
    Face clearly visible.
    
    Soft natural lighting.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    All six tiles must have consistent image dimensions and corner radii. Do not make one image larger than another., 5. IMAGE HOVER EFFECTS
    
    Apply subtle hover effects:
    
    Slight image zoom: scale(1.04).
    
    Smooth transition: 0.3 seconds.
    
    Keep images clipped within their rounded corners.
    
    No dramatic animations.
    
    Instagram promotional tile should also have a subtle hover effect.
    
    Each image should be individually clickable and support an optional Instagram post URL.
    
    6. COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Use the following brand colours:
    
    Section background: #FFFFFF
    
    Primary olive: #626B4C
    
    Secondary olive: #777D5D
    
    Button border: #C9CDBD
    
    Instagram tile background: #626B4C
    
    Instagram tile text: #FFFFFF
    
    Maintain a clean white-and-olive brand aesthetic.
    
    7. TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Use Montserrat exclusively.
    
    Eyebrow: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Main heading: Montserrat Bold.
    
    Button text: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Instagram tile text: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Maintain premium editorial typography with balanced spacing.
    
    8. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop
    
    Six images in one horizontal row.
    
    Heading on the left.
    
    Follow button on the right.
    
    Images span the available content width.
    
    Tablet
    
    Display four or five images depending on available width.
    
    Keep all image tiles equal in size.
    
    Allow horizontal scrolling if necessary.
    
    Mobile
    
    Heading at the top-left.
    
    Follow button positioned beneath or alongside the heading depending on available width.
    
    Gallery must support horizontal swipe scrolling.
    
    Display approximately 2.5 image tiles within the viewport to indicate more images are available.
    
    Image aspect ratio remains 1:1.
    
    Image width approximately 125px.
    
    Gap: 10px.
    
    Border radius: 10px.
    
    Hide horizontal scrollbar while retaining swipe functionality.
    
    Use 20px horizontal padding.
    
    Prevent horizontal page overflow.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; padding:65px 55px; box-sizing:border-box; background:#fff; color:#626b4c; font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},sans-serif; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap:24px; margin-bottom:30px; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { margin:0 0 8px; color:#777d5d; font-size:9px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:2px; line-height:1.3; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { margin:0; color:#626b4c; font-family:{{ settings.type_heading_font.family }},sans-serif; font-size:36px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.2; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__follow { display:inline-flex; min-height:42px; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:9px; padding:0 20px; border:1px solid #c9cdbd; border-radius:30px; background:#fff; color:#626b4c; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; line-height:1; text-decoration:none; white-space:nowrap; transition:background-color 180ms ease,border-color 180ms ease; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__follow:hover { background:#f7f8f4; border-color:#777d5d; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__follow:focus-visible,.ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature:focus-visible,.ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-link:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #626b4c; outline-offset:3px; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon { width:13px; height:13px; flex:0 0 13px; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:10px; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile { display:block; position:relative; width:100%; aspect-ratio:1; overflow:hidden; border-radius:12px; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-link { display:block; position:absolute; inset:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:inherit; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile img { display:block; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:center; transition:transform .3s ease; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-link:hover img { transform:scale(1.04); }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder { position:relative; width:100%; height:100%; background:#f4f4f1; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg { display:block; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-note { position:absolute; right:8px; bottom:8px; left:8px; padding:6px; border-radius:4px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.92); color:#626b4c; font-size:10px; line-height:1.3; text-align:center; pointer-events:none; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature { position:relative; display:flex; width:100%; height:100%; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; overflow:hidden; background:#626b4c; color:#fff; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; transition:background-color .3s ease; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature:hover { background:#555e41; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bamboo { position:absolute; width:80px; height:120px; color:#fff; opacity:.12; pointer-events:none; transition:transform .3s ease,opacity .3s ease; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bamboo--one { top:-12px; left:-10px; transform:rotate(-25deg); }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bamboo--two { right:-13px; bottom:-18px; transform:rotate(155deg); }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature:hover .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bamboo--one { transform:rotate(-20deg) scale(1.04); opacity:.17; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature:hover .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bamboo--two { transform:rotate(150deg) scale(1.04); opacity:.17; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-icon { position:relative; z-index:1; width:28px; height:28px; }
  .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-label { position:relative; z-index:1; color:#fff; font-size:11px; font-weight:500; line-height:1.3; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile img,.ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature,.ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bamboo,.ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__follow { transition:none; }
  }
  @media screen and (min-width:750px) and (max-width:1023px) {
    .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding-right:32px; padding-left:32px; }
    .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  }
  @media screen and (max-width:749px) {
    .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width:100%; padding:44px 20px; overflow:hidden; }
    .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header { align-items:flex-start; flex-wrap:wrap; flex-direction:row; gap:14px; margin-bottom:22px; }
    .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { font-size:28px; }
    .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid { display:flex; width:100%; gap:10px; overflow-x:auto; overflow-y:hidden; padding-bottom:2px; scroll-snap-type:x mandatory; scrollbar-width:none; -ms-overflow-style:none; }
    .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid::-webkit-scrollbar { display:none; }
    .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile { flex:0 0 125px; width:125px; scroll-snap-align:start; border-radius:10px; }
    .ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__follow { margin-left:auto; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header">
      <div><p class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">— #KISSANDKRY</p><h2 class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">Tiny Moments, Shared.</h2></div>
      <a class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__follow" href="https://www.instagram.com/kissandkry/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Follow @kissandkry on Instagram">
        <svg class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="6" r=".8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle></svg><span>Follow @kissandkry</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid">
      {% for i in (1..6) %}
        {% if i == 3 %}
          <div class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile">
            <a class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature" href="https://www.instagram.com/kissandkry/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View KISS & KRY on Instagram">
              <svg class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bamboo ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bamboo--one" viewBox="0 0 100 150" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 142C31 106 46 68 65 8M28 112C13 99 7 84 8 69c18 4 29 17 30 33M39 88C58 80 70 66 74 49c-19 1-32 11-39 28M52 57C39 44 35 29 40 13c16 9 24 23 21 39M23 124C42 117 59 104 68 87c-19-2-34 6-45 21" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              <svg class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bamboo ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bamboo--two" viewBox="0 0 100 150" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 142C31 106 46 68 65 8M28 112C13 99 7 84 8 69c18 4 29 17 30 33M39 88C58 80 70 66 74 49c-19 1-32 11-39 28M52 57C39 44 35 29 40 13c16 9 24 23 21 39M23 124C42 117 59 104 68 87c-19-2-34 6-45 21" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              <svg class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="6" r=".8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle></svg>
              <span class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-label">View on Instagram</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        {% else %}
          {% assign image_key = 'gallery_image_' | append: i %}
          {% assign url_key = 'gallery_url_' | append: i %}
          {% assign gallery_image = block.settings[image_key] %}
          {% assign gallery_url = block.settings[url_key] %}
          <div class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile">
            {% if gallery_image != blank %}
              {% if gallery_url != blank %}<a class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-link" href="{{ gallery_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View Instagram post featuring {{ gallery_image.alt | escape }}">{% endif %}
              <img src="{{ gallery_image | image_url: width: 500 }}" alt="{{ gallery_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="500" height="500">
              {% if gallery_url != blank %}</a>{% endif %}
            {% else %}<div class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<span class="ai-instagram-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-note">Add babywear photo {{ i }}</span></div>{% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Instagram gallery",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_width_percent", "label": "Desktop width", "min": 50, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Babywear photos" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "gallery_image_1", "label": "Baby close-up" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "gallery_url_1", "label": "Instagram post link" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "gallery_image_2", "label": "Baby in white" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "gallery_url_2", "label": "Instagram post link" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "gallery_image_4", "label": "Baby in soft white" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "gallery_url_4", "label": "Instagram post link" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "gallery_image_5", "label": "Baby on textured blanket" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "gallery_url_5", "label": "Instagram post link" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "gallery_image_6", "label": "Baby in white outfit" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "gallery_url_6", "label": "Instagram post link" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Instagram gallery" }],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "instagram-gallery-block"
}
{% endschema %}